---
title: Ylva - subagent admission, scheduling, and completion
---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Root as Root outer loop
    participant Context as Root Context
    participant Manager as ChildAgentManager
    participant Child as Subagent loop + forwarder
    participant Host as CLI / TUI driver
    participant Store as Session storage

    %% Sources: agent/tool_queue/spawn.rs, agent/child_agent_manager.rs,
    %% agent_factory.rs, agent/runtime/{subagents,commands}.rs.

    Root->>Manager: Approved spawn_subagent(task, type, briefing, call_id)
    alt Concurrency slot available
        Manager->>Child: Start via factory-built spawn closure
        Manager->>Store: Parent child_start event
        Manager-->>Root: Started(run_id)
    else Cap reached
        Manager->>Manager: Enqueue SpawnRequest FIFO
        Manager-->>Root: Queued(run_id)
    end
    Root->>Context: One tool result: subagent_accepted (running / queued)
    Note over Root,Host: Admission is not completion.<br/>The spawn bubble remains running / queued.
    Note over Manager,Child: The profile controls concurrent subagents. Non-positive means unlimited.<br/>Delegation is one level: subagent registries cannot spawn subagents.

    par Root may continue independent work
        Root->>Root: Continue ordinary tool / model loop, or settle idle
    and Subagents execute concurrently
        loop Live subagent activity
            Child-->>Root: UI updates tagged with run_id
            Root-->>Host: Forward tokens, usage, tools, or interactive pause
            opt Approval or clarify requires user input
                Host->>Root: ForChild(run_id, verdict / answer)
                Root->>Child: Route command to matching live subagent
                Note over Child,Host: Waiting for one subagent's input does not pause siblings.
            end
        end
    end

    alt Normal or failed terminal outcome
        Child->>Child: agent_finish result or harness-derived outcome
        Child->>Child: Drain UI forwarder after loop exits
        opt Loop returned a completed Context
            Child->>Store: Persist finished subagent transcript
        end
        Child-->>Root: FinishResult (after final UI updates)
        Root->>Context: Append hidden completion notice (canonical + bounded model view)
        Root-->>Host: ChildAgentDone, then spawn ToolDone
        Root->>Manager: record_child_result, then on_child_finished(run_id)
        Manager->>Store: Parent child_result event
        Manager->>Manager: Free only this slot
        loop FIFO requests while slots are free
            Manager->>Child: Start next queued subagent
            Manager->>Store: Parent child_start event
        end
        alt Other running or queued runs remain
            Root->>Root: Record completion without a completion-only reprompt
        else All outstanding subagents terminal
            alt Root idle and iteration budget permits
                Root->>Root: Start one aggregate continuation
            else Root busy
                Root->>Root: Defer continuation to its own safe response / queue boundary
            end
        end
    else Stop or clear
        Root->>Manager: cancel_all()
        Manager->>Child: Cancel running tasks and remove queued requests
        Child-->>Manager: Join cancelled tasks
        Manager-->>Root: Cancellation bookkeeping
        Root->>Root: Do not resume root for cancelled completions
        Note over Root,Context: Clear also changes generation and replaces context/session.<br/>Late outcomes from cancelled runs cannot enter the new conversation.
    end

    Note over Root,Context: Terminal results never create a second tool result for the spawn call ID.<br/>The final model answer must be self-contained. Hidden notices are not user-visible replies.
